le_record_index":"221368","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1660219004:0":{"text":"때로는 선한 의도가 악의적인 음모보다 더 큰 상처를 남기기도 합니다.","source_cn":"有些时候，善良的念头，反倒比恶意的阴谋带来的伤害更大。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8E2E74B3ECFCE63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1660219005:0":{"text":"저희의 과거는 전부 현실에서 비롯돼요. 제 가족도, 친구도... 동료들과 페기도 전부 현실에 있다고요!","source_cn":"我们过去的一切都从现实里来，我的家人在那里，我的朋友们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC201A7F24AF7224D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1660219006:0":{"text":"나, 낯선 사람과 마주하는 건 무섭지만... 땅거미 숲은 제가 필요해요!","source_cn":"虽、虽然很害怕和陌生人接触，但是，但是薄暮丛林的大家需要我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D7AA01E2857501F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1660219007:0":{"text":"아르사와 가족들이 기다리고 있어. 돌아가야 해.","source_cn":"阿尔萨和家人在等着，我一定要回去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CBFEE86B49CA48F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1660219008:0":{"text":"다들 고집불통이네, 일리아.","source_cn":"他们真的太固执了，伊莱亚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34A57C749C83496B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1660219009:0":{"text":"저러다 다칠 거 같아, 라이라.","source_cn":"他们真的会受伤的，莱拉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0015C2FF06D263E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1660219010:0":{"text":"하암... 다들 너무 시끄러워요.","source_cn":"呼啊……你们真吵呀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4E7E9BEEA4FF8AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1660219011:0":{"text":"이런, 아로라가 깼어요.","source_cn":"不好，奥萝菈醒了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E2FC96D1CCB39E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1660219012:0":{"text":"세상에, 목소리가 너무 컸나봐요...","source_cn":"糟糕，我们的声音太大了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A81508896DD48FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1660219013:0":{"text":"아로라는 하품을 하고 눈을 비비며 주변을 둘러보았다.","source_cn":"奥萝菈的身影渐渐浮现，她打了个哈欠，揉着眼睛看着四下的一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x295A4E0BB91B8B1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1660219014:0":{"text":"음... <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 안녕하세요.","sou